        "en": "**The app cannot check this part.** For the writing, please use pen and paper. For the speaking, say it out loud and, if you can, practise with a native speaker or a teacher who can correct you.\n\n**Write (100–120 words).** Write a short covering letter for a job you would like.\n\n**Speak (about 2 minutes).** Answer aloud the classic interview questions: tell me about yourself, your strengths, your weaknesses, why this job."
